WEBVTT

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.240
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.140
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.950
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.400
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.650
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.000
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.410
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.620
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.730
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.510
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.350
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:02.760
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.110
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.960
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.210
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.280
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:23.190
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.960
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.220
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.490
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.110
I know that...

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.950
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.840
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.710
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.020
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.750
Move it! Move it! Move it!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.410
Aren't you going a bit too fast?

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:57.420
We've only got two minutes and forty-eight point three-five seconds before the bell rings!

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.130
Amu-chan, hurry up, hurry up! We're going to be late!

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:04.880
At this pace, it'll take another four minutes to get to the classroom.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:07.530
Come on, Amu-chan!

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:10.190
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:12.080
She got mad.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.260
Time to run. Time to run.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:17.610
It was noisy enough with just Ran, and now that Miki's hatched...

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:25.110
There's still one egg left. I wonder what type of Guardian Character it'll be.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:31.080
Episode 3
Flaky and Fluffy! Leave it to Su!

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:40.950
I have to give Hinamori-senpai this fan letter; it's full of my feelings for her!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.770
Hinamori-senpai!

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.570
U-Um...

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:48.180
Hinamori-san!

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.600
We heard! We heard!

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.490
You really refused to join the Guardians?

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.920
Only Hinamori-san could do that!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.740
You're so cool!

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.660
H-How do you know that?

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.130
It's the talk of the whole school!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.460
You know?

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:05.660
I refused because I don't want to stand out. B-But it looks like it might've had the opposite effect.

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.140
Break time!

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.620
I just want to be normal. Why is this happening?

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.730
Guys, I want to buy a new cell phone strap.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:21.130
Then why don't we stop by the station? I know of a cute shop there.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:21.870
Really?

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.340
Yeah? What's it like?

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.440
Well, it just opened and...

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.530
Cool!

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:32.500
After school.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.930
Can we meet at your house, Manami?

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.200
Okay!

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.610
Hey, guys, why don't we invite Hinamori-san?

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:45.080
Should we? I'm not sure that store would suit her cool style.

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.550
I'd feel terrible if I just got laughed at.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.050
Okay then.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:52.680
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.140
Nothing.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:58.100
I thought I was getting a bit closer to everyone,

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.270
but it kind of feels like I've gotten nowhere instead.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.520
Amu-chan!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.310
Ah, so cute. You really are a scaredy-cat, aren't you?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.030
W-What do you want?

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.770
I thought we could hang out and become best friends!

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:14.660
N-No matter what you say, this is just a plot to get me to join the Guardians, isn't it?

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:15.710
Oh, you knew?

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.950
I was hoping I didn't.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.120
Nadeshiko, I suppose we'll have to...

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:24.270
Right, then. Secret Amu-chan Weapon: A picture of Hotori-kun dozing off.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.870
Hold on! Why are you showing me that?

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.870
Oh? Well, you do like Hotori-kun, don't you?

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.330
I have many others.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:34.370
Some were taken during his private time, others are from his personal profile.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.410
And if you join the Guardians, you'll get them all.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.500
Should I?

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.210
Amu-chan, don't be duped by her scheme!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.090
Have some dignity!

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:44.380
They're right! Don't think I'm so low I'd get suckered by a bribe!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.220
Yeah, we're not that low!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.840
Even though she was about to give in.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.680
You're a nice girl.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:55.180
I guess I should stop playing tricks and just wish you and Hotori-kun the best.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.990
Listen, why do you keep talking about him?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:01.540
We'll be going to his house tomorrow. Why don't you come with us?

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.990
B-But... I can't impose like that all of a sudden.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:09.690
This is a rare opportunity. It will be the perfect chance for you to get ahead of your rivals.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.590
Y-You have a point. That might work out.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.570
She's getting lured in. She's getting lured in.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:18.730
If you bring something you've made yourself, I'm sure it'll score you a lot of points.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.510
Something I've made?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.830
I could never. I'm terrible at Home Ec stuff. Really bad.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.120
Don't worry, I'll teach you.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.070
So it's settled. Meet me back here in thirty minutes.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.240
W-Wait.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:37.710
A present for the prince... Doing something with a friend...

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.920
You know, this is kind of...

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.120
Exciting?

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.550
N-Not really. It's going to be a pain.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:46.120
Maybe, but if we don't hurry up, we'll be late!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.550
Oh yeah! Run! Run!

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:57.120
Are you sure we can just come in here?

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.610
Oh, it's fine. I am a Guardian, after all.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.090
Speaking all high and mighty...

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.810
Let's get started.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.030
We'll be making a fruit tart, okay?

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:07.900
Why?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.320
You're kind of making all the decisions here.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.330
Because Hotori-kun loves fruit tarts.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.370
The prince? In that case...

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.310
Oh, and it's better if you don't call him Prince.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.680
First, let's beat the butter.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.000
Yeah, that looks good.

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:02.800
It's done!

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.730
It baked well.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.270
Now, all that's left is to make the cream filling.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.360
You can go ahead and get started on the rest.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.100
Where are you going?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.670
I'm getting the fruit for the garnish.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.900
Nadeshiko is nice, isn't she?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.570
Think she'll be a good friend?

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:29.350
But I'm not confident. Can I really do this by myself?

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:32.150
You can!

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:39.360
You can do it yourself! Character Chan-

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.030
Okay, that's enough.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.770
Hey! You're that guy!

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:53.770
The pervert who dresses up with cat ears!

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.510
Dresses up?

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.590
Get away from me, pervert!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.850
So the second one hatched?

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.160
But now...

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:09.330
I wonder if this is the Embryo.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.820
The third egg!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:13.650
Give that back!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.260
Why are you after my eggs?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.760
Embryo...

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.560
What's the Embryo?

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.510
Stop right there! Get away from her!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.580
Amu-chan, are you okay?

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:46.900
Yeah.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.280
What am I doing?

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.580
Temari, Character Change!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.720
Right away!

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:57.290
Chin, Ton, Shan!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.610
What?! Nadeshiko-san changes into that kind of character?!

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:24.360
What should we do? What should we do?

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:24.350
Amu-chan, let's Character Change, too!

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:31.610
Don't panic. Don't panic.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:40.380
Leave this to Su!

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:59.620
Leave this to Su!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:00.910
Su?

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:06.320
Let's go, Amu-chan. Let's end this, quick and fluffy!

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:07.820
Chip!

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.480
Syrup!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.560
Whip!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.890
I'm going to drown!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.620
It's a flood of whipped cream!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.830
What the heck is wrong with her?!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:32.880
I-I'm safe.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.640
That was really close.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:42.050
So the third one's not the Embryo either.

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:45.490
The Embryo again? What <i>is</i> it?

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:47.210
Amu-chan, bad news!

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.760
The tart...

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:58.480
This is terrible.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.530
We just finished making it, too.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:06.140
It's fine. I'm not the type who makes desserts in the first place.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:10.900
This is better than the shame I'd feel over giving him something that sucked.

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:14.260
So really, nothing's wrong.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.920
Let's go, Ikuto.

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:26.990
Amu-chan, let's remake it.

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.650
No, it's okay.

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:31.840
We don't have enough ingredients to make more.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:34.440
Amu-chan, it's all right.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:39.700
With only this much dough left, we might not be able to make a tart, but we can make something else.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.320
Character Change!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.350
The cookies are done!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.240
We might not've made a tart...

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.000
But we made cookies!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.320
Amu-chan, you're great!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:17.840
They're done.

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:23.690
Just leave it to me!

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.810
Sorry about that.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.800
The cookies turned out well!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.120
All we have to do is wrap them!

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.850
I wonder what color ribbon I should use?

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.350
Maybe I should attach a card, too.

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:57.110
It's not like me to worry about these things.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:58.850
In that case...

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.760
To a girl who can be cute and straightforward...

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:01.950
Character Change!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:01.930
W-Wait!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:12.870
Dear Prince: I've made some cookies for you. Think of me while-you-eat-them!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:18.850
From the actually shy Hinamori Amu. I'll wait for your response for the rest of my life.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.970
Add the card!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.080
And the wrapping!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.790
And the ribbon!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.310
Perfect!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.330
Dummies!

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:33.760
There's no way I can give him something so embarrassing!

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.930
But the green one is so much cuter.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.990
Looks like this egg wasn't it either-nya.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.590
What's wrong-nya?

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:48.850
Nothing really.

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:55.410
Nadeshiko's late.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.780
I wonder if something happened.

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.490
What are you doing?

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:09.900
Let's give him this one!

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:13.720
The one with the green ribbon is much cuter!

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.580
I can't give him that.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:16.650
Besides, this one has-

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:17.710
Hinamori-san.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.750
T-Tadase-kun?

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:27.620
I received word that Fujisaki-san will be a bit late, so I came in her place.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:31.670
Oh! I-I was just in the area! Bye!

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.050
Hinamori-san?

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.250
That surprised me.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:45.730
He came out of nowhere, and I just took off without thinking.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:49.250
But I guess it's okay. I did give him the cookies.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:52.980
Why is that here?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.790
Because you gave him the green-ribboned one instead.

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.010
That means...

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.330
It was the one with the card in it.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:09.890
Dear Prince: I've made some cookies for you. Think of me while-you-eat-them!

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:10.800
No!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:11.410
I'll die!

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.660
I'll just die if he sees that!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:15.030
I'll die from embarrassment!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.270
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.820
W-Wait, don't push.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:24.970
Infiltration successful, kind of.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:32.390
Listen up. We have to reclaim control of the bag before the prince can open it, no matter what.

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:33.540
Roger!

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:38.590
This is kind of like Mission Impossible!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:41.500
Based on what we find in the room at the end, let's go in.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.530
A boy's room.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.740
Amu-chan, aren't you getting excited for a different reason?

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:49.090
Let's break in!

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:56.690
This is the prince's... Tadase-kun's room.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.420
It's pretty clean.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.040
There it is!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.480
What are you doing?

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:10.610
This is called breaking and entering.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.810
The prince's Guardian Character?

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:16.570
So you're the one with the three Guardian Characters.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:20.260
Just as I suspected, none of you three are the Embryo.

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:24.780
Wow, when you look closely, he's like a mini Tadase-kun! How totally cute!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.540
What are you doing? I can't breathe!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:30.020
So what is that Embryo thing, anyway, Mini Tadase-kun?

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:36.900
My name is Kiseki, you insolent fool. Listen up. The Embryo is a magical egg capable of granting any wish.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.150
<i>Any </i>wish?

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:42.890
Right, and that's why many seek it.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:47.300
And why you will become one of my subjects, and join the search-

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.480
Does that mean Tadase-kun has a wish he wants granted?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:52.820
Kiseki, is someone there?

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:55.190
Huh? Hinamori-san?

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:59.450
N-N-No!

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:04.540
I'm so glad you came to visit.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:06.290
S-Sure.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:09.040
I guess there's nothing to worry about now that we got it back.

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.930
It was so cute, too. Oh well.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:14.720
But you still don't want to join the Guardians?

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:18.390
I would feel a lot better if you were there with me.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.180
Let's look for the Embryo together.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:23.260
We need your help.

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:27.540
Tadase-kun, is there something you want to wish for?

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:28.650
Yes.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:34.790
You have three Guardian Characters, even though a person usually only has one.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:37.280
On top of that, you can do Character Transformations.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:41.060
If you joined our group, it would mean a significant increase in our strength.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:45.150
I guess I really do like him.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:48.870
I wonder if I'm up to the challenge of helping him with his dream.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:53.280
Prince.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:54.800
Prince?

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:58.910
Did you just call me "prince"?

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:02.310
Do not call me a prince!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.070
We haven't seen the King in a while.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:11.850
What's going on?!

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:14.760
This is why I warned you not to call him "prince."

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.180
When did you warn me?!

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.420
When he gets like this, no one can touch him! Yay!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.680
Yay?

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:24.000
Mark my words, commoners! I am no weak prince!

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:25.490
I am the King!

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.730
Y-You mean to say that Tadase's dream is...

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.520
That's right! World domination!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.530
You're evil, Tadase-kun.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:40.870
It's okay, Amu-chan. He'll turn back to normal soon.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.810
Wait, so all of you have been working to further his ambitions?

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:44.840
Of course!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.550
We've all been searching for the Embryo together!

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.220
W-Why?

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:50.930
Because it's something to do!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.190
The Guardians are ridiculous.

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.770
Tadase-kun.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:07.070
Whenever I Character Change, I get like that.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.290
You must be shocked, Hinamori-san.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:13.140
T-That's not true at all, pri... I mean, Tadase-kun.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:18.050
Before, I wasn't fit to hold the King's Chair at all.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:21.590
That's right. Tadase's actually very shy.

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.620
He really struggled with talking in front of big crowds.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:29.090
Exactly, and that's why I wished to become stronger.

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:32.700
I wished to become someone else.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:39.820
Please give me the courage to be reborn as the person I truly want to be.

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:43.540
The prince was just like me.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:46.110
And then my Guardian Egg was born.

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:51.360
I become who Tadase would like to be. That's what Guardian Characters are.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.360
So then, all of you...

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:00.400
How long are you going to stay depressed?

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.490
Have some willpower, you greenhorn king.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.000
That's right, Tadase.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.660
Jeez. Not you, too, Kiseki.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.750
It's not just me!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:12.010
I wanted to be someone else. I felt depressed and got in over my head.

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.390
But it was the same for everyone!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:15.940
Amu-chan.

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.990
Seriously, you always amaze me.

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.280
Jeez.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:27.180
U-Um... These... If you'd like...

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.360
Thank you.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.060
They smell like cookies!

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:35.710
I want some, too!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.250
Cut it out, Yaya-chan.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.530
Let's all have some.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.470
Good idea.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:47.330
Yay! Thanks, Amu-chi!

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.760
But Yaya can only have three.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.260
I'm tired.

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:00.440
All of the Guardians were nicer than I expected.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:01.480
Yeah.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.940
I'm kind of sad, though. We weren't able to give him this.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:09.950
Everything that happened today was your fault! You should reflect on your actions a bit!

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:12.500
Amu-chan is scary!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.320
Jeez.

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:32.360
Nothing good has happened since you guys showed up.

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:39.830
Well, maybe it's not all bad.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.250
That's all for last week.

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:49.950
Continuing on, and although this may be unusual, we'll be announcing a new Guardian member.

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:58.980
The new Guardian member, in other words, the fifth Guardian, is...

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:01.150
The Joker: Hinamori Amu!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:17.360
The J-Joker? What the heck is that?!

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:40.790
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:47.190
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:48.010
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:54.170
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.170 --> 00:23:00.520
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:05.030
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:08.550
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:13.390
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:14.860
my darling.

00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:18.650
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:21.610
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:25.040
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:28.310
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:32.090
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:36.340
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:41.280
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:52.970
It's nice that I'm getting along with everyone, but...

00:23:53.350 --> 00:23:55.390
What did they mean by "joker"?!

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:57.750
Someone that sneaks around following pe-

00:23:57.780 --> 00:23:58.920
That's a stalker!

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:00.080
Something that stores your lugga-

00:24:00.110 --> 00:24:00.850
That's a locker!

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:02.370
Something green you eat in summer-

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:04.290
A watermelon! Wait, that's wrong!

00:24:04.780 --> 00:24:07.910
A joker is a trump card.

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:09.530
Oh, I see.

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:10.930
Wait, who are you?

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:14.220
Next time on Shugo Chara: I'm the Trump Card!?

00:24:14.280 --> 00:24:17.240
The thing that goes "spray spray" when your mom's ironing.

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:19.340
That's a mister!
